{title: Ei Mon Tomake Dilam}
{artist: Anupam Mahtim Shakib}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Ei Mon [D]Tomake [G]Dilam...        [G]Ei Prem [D]Tomake [G]Dilam...
Tumi [Bm]Chokher Araal Hou..        [Em]Kache Kiba Dure Rou...
[D]Mone Rekho Amio [G]Chilam....        [G]Ei Mon [D]Tomake [G]Dilam...
[G]Ei Prem [D]Tomake [G]Dilam...        [G]Bokul Er [Em]Mala Shuka [G]be...
[G]Rekhe Debo [Em]Tar Shuro [C]vi.. [G],        [G]Din Giye [Em]Raate Luka [G]be...
[G]Muchho Na Ko [Em]Amari [C]Chhobi.        Ami [D]Minoti Kore [G]Gela...m
Tumi [Bm]Chokher Araal Hou..        [Em]Kache Kiba Dure Rou...
[D]Mone Rekho Amio [G]Chilam....        [G]Ei Mon [D]Tomake [G]Dilam...
[G]Ei Prem [D]Tomake [G]Dilam...        [G]Bhalobeshe [Em]Ami Bare [G]Bar...
[G]Tomari O [Em]Mone Hara [C]bo... [G],        [G]Ei Jibone [Em]Ami Je [G]Tomer....
[G]Moroneo [Em]Tomari [C]Robo...        Tumi [D]Bhulo Na Amar [G]Naam
Tumi [Bm]Chokher Araal Hou..        [Em]Kache Kiba Dure Rou...
[D]Mone Rekho Amio [G]Chilam....
